  "title": "Roasted Autumn Root Vegetables",
  "description": "Roasting really brings out the earthy flavors of these beets, potatoes, parsnips, turnips, and rutabaga. A bit of vinegar and goat cheese add just the right amount of zing.",
  "authors": [
    "WillMetz"
